      <p class="founder-tagline">Strategic HR &amp; People leader scaling teams with discipline and heart.</p>
      <p class="founder-bio">Strategic HR and People &amp; Culture leader with over eight years of experience across consulting, sustainability, healthcare and B-Corp environments. Track record of strengthening People systems in scaling teams of 150+ employees.</p>
      <div class="founder-expertise">
        <h4>Areas of expertise</h4>
