    <div class="founder-media">
      <span class="founder-bignum">02</span>
      <div class="founder-portrait">
        <img src="/images/sheila-saibala.jpg"
             alt="Sheila Saibala — Co-Founder, Mawingu HR Solutions"
             loading="lazy"
             decoding="async"
             width="640" height="640">
      </div>
      <span class="founder-role-chip">Governance, Risk &amp; IT Advisory</span>
    </div>
    <div class="founder-info">
      <span class="founder-eyebrow">Co-Founder &middot; Partner</span>
      <h3 class="founder-name">Sheila <span class="serif">Saibala</span></h3>
      <p class="founder-tagline">Global governance &amp; IT-grounded operational resilience.</p>
      <p class="founder-bio">International transformation and governance specialist combining enterprise risk, IT service management and cybersecurity risk &amp; governance experience across Agile and compliance-heavy environments. Brings global governance discipline &mdash; and an IT-grounded view of operational resilience &mdash; to African growth-stage businesses.</p>
      <div class="founder-expertise">
        <h4>Areas of expertise</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>Enterprise risk</li>
          <li>Change management</li>
          <li>Governance systems</li>
          <li>Business continuity</li>
